y for the transported items.</p><ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;"><li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>32ft MX Enclosed Container:</strong></span></li></ul><p>For larger or multiple household items, the 32ft MX Enclosed Container fulfills the requirements. With air-suspension systems, it provides a safe and comfortable journey for your belongings during the transport process.</p><ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;"><li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Air-Suspension Systems:</strong></span></li></ul><p>Shree Ashirwad's specialized fleet features air-suspension systems in all three types of enclosed containers. These systems help to reduce vibrations, jolts, and bumps during transportation, ensuring a secure and comfortable journey for your belongings. The air-suspension systems also enhance the overall driving experience for the truck driver.</p><ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;"><li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span><strong>Speed Governors Calibrated to 60 km/h:</strong></span></li></ul><p>To guarantee a safe transportation process, the company calibrates the speed governors of their specialized fleet trucks to a maximum speed of 60 km/h. This ensures a controlled and safe journey for both the truck and the transported goods.</p><ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 18px 0;"><li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="